---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Docs — gait">
  <main class="mx-auto min-h-screen max-w-5xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-8">
    <a href="/gait/" class="text-sm text-[#52e5d0]">← Back to gait</a>
    <div class="mt-20 max-w-3xl"><div class="eyebrow mb-5">documentation</div><h1 class="display text-5xl font-semibold text-white">Build with behavioral signals.</h1><p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-400">The practical guide to capturing, aggregating and consuming gait snapshots.</p></div>
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/quickstart/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#52e5d0]">01 · start here</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Quickstart</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Create a browser collector and inspect your first local snapshot.</p></a>
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/api/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9b8cff]">02 · contract</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">API & snapshots</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Lifecycle, configuration and the versioned JSON output.</p></a>
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/architecture/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9b8cff]">03 · under the hood</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Architecture</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Core, browser source, adapters and the performance boundary.</p></a>
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/browser/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#f6c76b]">04 · platform</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Browser events</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Pointer, keyboard, visibility, clocks and unsupported capabilities.</p></a>
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/performance/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#f6c76b]">05 · production</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Performance</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">Sampling, flush cadence, memory bounds and framework renders.</p></a>
      <a class="glass rounded-3xl p-6 transition hover:-translate-y-1" href="/gait/docs/privacy/"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#fb7185]">06 · boundaries</div><h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-white">Privacy & trust</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">What gait captures, what it never claims and how to interpret confidence.</p></a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10"><div class="eyebrow mb-4">framework adapters</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-[#52e5d0]/40 hover:text-white" href="/gait/docs/react/">React</a><a class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-[#52e5d0]/40 hover:text-white" href="/gait/docs/vue/">Vue</a><a class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-[#52e5d0]/40 hover:text-white" href="/gait/docs/svelte/">Svelte</a><a class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-[#52e5d0]/40 hover:text-white" href="/gait/docs/angular/">Angular</a></div></div>
  </main>
</Layout>
